# 🔗 My Custom Linktree

This is my very first practical project on my journey to becoming a Front-End Developer! 
I built this links page (Linktree style) completely from scratch to practice my skills in web structure and styling.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* **HTML5:** Page semantics and structure.
* **CSS3:** Flexbox, Box Model, Transition effects (Hover), and responsiveness.

## 🚀 What I learned in this project?

* How to use semantic tags (`<header>`, `<main>`) instead of just relying on `<div>`.
* How to center elements vertically and horizontally using **Flexbox**.
* How to import and manipulate images and native colors through CSS.
* The fundamental difference between structural files (HTML) and style files (CSS).

